Test Case Type:
Direct On-Us Conversion Reconciliation

Test Case Long Description:
Validate that Direct On-Us Conversion includes all direct applications that progressed to a final accepted application outcome, irrespective of whether the interim On-Us decision was Accept, Refer or Decline.

Expected Results:
Direct On-Us Conversion should equal the sum of:
Direct On-Us Accept → Application Accept
+ Direct On-Us Refer → Application Accept
+ Direct On-Us Decline → Application Accept.

The calculated volume should align with the corresponding Tableau measure for the same application decision date range.

